.TH "FAILLOG" "8" "07/30/2026" "shadow\-utils 4\&.20\&.0" "دستورهای مدیریت سیستم (System Management Commands)"
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * Define some portability stuff
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
